---
// Hakkımızda Modülü
---
<div id="panel-hakkimizda" class="content-panel hidden w-full space-y-6 transition-all duration-300">
	<!-- ÜST BANNER -->
	<div class="w-full bg-gray-50/70 border border-gray-200/50 rounded-xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center text-left">
		<div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-900 p-2.5 shadow-md shrink-0">
			<svg xmlns="http://w3.org" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="36" height="36">
				<path fill="#000000" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5.63 24l4.696-8.137h9.397L24.42 24l-4.698 8.137h-9.397z" />
				<path fill="#f59e0b" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M23.58 13.637L28.274 5.5h9.397l4.698 8.137l-4.698 8.137h-9.397z" />
				<path fill="#f59e0b" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M23.58 34.363l4.695-8.137h9.397l4.698 8.137l-4.698 8.137h-9.397z" />
			</svg>
		</div>
		<div class="flex-grow flex flex-col">
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center justify-center space-y-1.5 w-full mb-3">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight m-0">Polinasyon</h1>
				<h2 class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-amber-600 uppercase m-0 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-amber-100 inline-block">Kanatların Matematiği</h2>
			</div>
			<p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base italic font-medium m-0 text-center md:text-left">
				"Her şey, doğanın o kusursuz geometrisine duyduğumuz hayranlıkla başladı. Polinasyon; Simav ve Çitgöl topraklarında, ballı bitkiler ile kovan başı bal verimi artırmayı hedefleyen bir doğa manifestosudur. Biz inanıyoruz ki arıcılık, kovanın sınırlarını aşan teknik bir memleket meselesidir."
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- ALT BANNER -->
	<div class="w-full bg-gray-50/70 border border-gray-200/50 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
		<table class="w-full text-left border-collapse m-0">
			<tbody>
				<tr class="border-b border-gray-200/40 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100/30">
					<th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 w-1/3 sm:w-1/4 bg-gray-100/40">Polinasyon</th>
					<td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Arıcılık</td>
				</tr>
				<tr class="border-b border-gray-200/40 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100/30">
					<th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 bg-gray-100/40">İşletme no</th>
					<td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-mono font-bold text-gray-800">450000808299</td>
				</tr>
				<tr class="border-b border-gray-200/40 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100/30">
					<th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 bg-gray-100/40">PWA</th>
					<td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm"><a href="https://polinasyon.org" target="_blank" class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-700 no-underline font-extrabold transition-colors">App</a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr class="border-b border-gray-200/40 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100/30">
					<th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 bg-gray-100/40">PWA</th>
					<td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm"><a href="https://polinasyon.org" target="_blank" class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-700 no-underline font-extrabold transition-colors">Lab</a></td>
				</tr>
				<tr class="transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100/30">
					<th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 bg-gray-100/40">Email</th>
					<td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm"><a href="mailto:info@polinasyon.org" class="text-gray-800 hover:text-amber-600 no-underline font-bold transition-colors">info@polinasyon.org</a></td>
				</tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	</div>
</div>

